IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `cpfta-types`
IMPORT `cpfta-part1`

-- Tests for Part 1 (s 2) and the First Schedule.  Every expectation is taken from
-- the text of s 2(1), 2(2), 2(3) and the First Schedule, never from the code.
-- Positional construction with OF; the ruler above each block names the columns.

§ `Tests -- Part 1`

§§ `2(1) "supplier"`

--                                     business, provides, makes, promotes, receives, employee/agent
`a supplier who provides goods` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE,  FALSE,   FALSE
`a supplier who only manufactures` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE,  FALSE,   FALSE
`a supplier who only promotes` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,   FALSE,   FALSE
`a supplier who only receives consideration` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`a person who provides goods outside business` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a person in business doing none of (a) to (d)` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`an employee or agent of a supplier` MEANS `Supplier Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE

#ASSERT `the person is a supplier` `a supplier who provides goods`
#ASSERT `the person is a supplier` `a supplier who only manufactures`
#ASSERT `the person is a supplier` `a supplier who only promotes`
#ASSERT `the person is a supplier` `a supplier who only receives consideration`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a supplier` `a person who provides goods outside business`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a supplier` `a person in business doing none of (a) to (d)`
#ASSERT `the person is a supplier` `an employee or agent of a supplier`

§§ `2(1) "consumer" and 2(2)`

--                                       individual, exclusively business, holds out, receives, obliged to pay for another
`an individual who receives goods` MEANS `Consumer Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`an individual who pays for goods for another` MEANS `Consumer Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`an individual acting exclusively in business` MEANS `Consumer Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE,  FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`an individual who holds out as acting exclusively in business` MEANS `Consumer Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE
`a company that receives goods` MEANS `Consumer Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`an individual who neither receives nor pays` MEANS `Consumer Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the person is a consumer` `an individual who receives goods`
#ASSERT `the person is a consumer` `an individual who pays for goods for another`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a consumer` `an individual acting exclusively in business`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a consumer` `an individual who holds out as acting exclusively in business`
#ASSERT `the person is treated as acting exclusively in the course of business` `an individual who holds out as acting exclusively in business`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a consumer` `a company that receives goods`
#ASSERT NOT `the person is a consumer` `an individual who neither receives nor pays`

§§ `2(1) "financial product" and "financial services"; 2(3)`

--                                  MAS, Commodity Trading Act, prescribed, exempted
`a thing regulated by the MAS` MEANS `Regulated Thing Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a thing under the Commodity Trading Act` MEANS `Regulated Thing Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`a thing under a prescribed written law` MEANS `Regulated Thing Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE
`a thing supplied by an exempted person` MEANS `Regulated Thing Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`an unregulated thing` MEANS `Regulated Thing Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the thing is a financial product` `a thing regulated by the MAS`
#ASSERT `the thing is a financial product` `a thing under the Commodity Trading Act`
#ASSERT `the thing is a financial product` `a thing under a prescribed written law`
#ASSERT `the thing is a financial product` `a thing supplied by an exempted person`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is a financial product` `an unregulated thing`
#ASSERT `the service is financial services` `a thing supplied by an exempted person`
#ASSERT NOT `the service is financial services` `an unregulated thing`

§§ `2(1) "residential property", "voucher", "goods"`

--                                            house/flat/premises, permitted as dwelling, being constructed
`a permitted dwelling house` MEANS `Residential Property Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a dwelling under construction` MEANS `Residential Property Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`premises not permitted as a dwelling` MEANS `Residential Property Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`not premises at all` MEANS `Residential Property Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE

#ASSERT `the thing is residential property` `a permitted dwelling house`
#ASSERT `the thing is residential property` `a dwelling under construction`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is residential property` `premises not permitted as a dwelling`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is residential property` `not premises at all`

--                          document, right to obtain, right to obtain at a discount
`a gift voucher` MEANS `Voucher Facts` OF TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE
`a discount coupon` MEANS `Voucher Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE
`a mere document` MEANS `Voucher Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE
`a promise not in a document` MEANS `Voucher Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the thing is a voucher` `a gift voucher`
#ASSERT `the thing is a voucher` `a discount coupon`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is a voucher` `a mere document`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is a voucher` `a promise not in a document`

-- Goods Facts: personal property, chattel, credit, regulation, residential, voucher.
`no regulated thing` MEANS `Regulated Thing Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`no voucher` MEANS `Voucher Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`not residential` MEANS `Residential Property Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

`personal property` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `no regulated thing`, `not residential`, `no voucher`
`a fixture to be attached` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, `no regulated thing`, `not residential`, `no voucher`
`credit on the security of land` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, `no regulated thing`, `not residential`, `no voucher`
`a financial product as goods` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a thing regulated by the MAS`, `not residential`, `no voucher`
`a house as goods` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `no regulated thing`, `a permitted dwelling house`, `no voucher`
`a voucher as goods` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `no regulated thing`, `not residential`, `a gift voucher`
`a thing that is not goods` MEANS `Goods Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `no regulated thing`, `not residential`, `no voucher`

#ASSERT `the thing is goods` `personal property`
#ASSERT `the thing is goods` `a fixture to be attached`
#ASSERT `the thing is goods` `credit on the security of land`
#ASSERT `the thing is goods` `a financial product as goods`
#ASSERT `the thing is goods` `a house as goods`
#ASSERT `the thing is goods` `a voucher as goods`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is goods` `a thing that is not goods`

§§ `2(1) "time share contract" and "services"`

--                               confers rights, specified period, employment, insurance, years
`a 3 year time share` MEANS `Time Share Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 3
`a 2 year time share` MEANS `Time Share Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, 2
`a time share under employment` MEANS `Time Share Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, 5
`a time share under insurance` MEANS `Time Share Facts` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, 5

#ASSERT `the contract is a time share contract` `a 3 year time share`
#ASSERT NOT `the contract is a time share contract` `a 2 year time share`
#ASSERT NOT `the contract is a time share contract` `a time share under employment`
#ASSERT NOT `the contract is a time share contract` `a time share under insurance`

-- Services Facts: repair, membership, club for profit, time share right, time share
-- contract, financial service record, offered as financial services.
`a repair service` MEANS `Services Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a 2 year time share`, `no regulated thing`, FALSE
`membership of a profit-making club` MEANS `Services Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, `a 2 year time share`, `no regulated thing`, FALSE
`membership of a non-profit club` MEANS `Services Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, `a 2 year time share`, `no regulated thing`, FALSE
`a right to use time share accommodation` MEANS `Services Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, `a 3 year time share`, `no regulated thing`, FALSE
`a right under a 2 year arrangement` MEANS `Services Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, `a 2 year time share`, `no regulated thing`, FALSE
`a financial service` MEANS `Services Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, `a 2 year time share`, `a thing regulated by the MAS`, TRUE

#ASSERT `the thing is services` `a repair service`
#ASSERT `the thing is services` `membership of a profit-making club`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is services` `membership of a non-profit club`
#ASSERT `the thing is services` `a right to use time share accommodation`
#ASSERT NOT `the thing is services` `a right under a 2 year arrangement`
#ASSERT `the thing is services` `a financial service`

§§ `2(1) "consumer transaction"; First Schedule`

--                                  supply, agreement, immovable, lease of dwelling for rent, time share, employment
`a supply of goods to a consumer` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`an agreement to supply` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a purchase of immovable property` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE, FALSE
`a lease of a dwelling for rent` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE,  TRUE,  FALSE, FALSE
`a time share contract transaction` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE
`service under employment` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE
`no supply and no agreement` MEANS `Transaction Facts` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

#ASSERT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `a supply of goods to a consumer`
#ASSERT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `an agreement to supply`
#ASSERT `the transaction is an excluded transaction` `a purchase of immovable property`
#ASSERT NOT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `a purchase of immovable property`
#ASSERT NOT `the transaction is an excluded transaction` `a lease of a dwelling for rent`
#ASSERT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `a lease of a dwelling for rent`
#ASSERT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `a time share contract transaction`
#ASSERT NOT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `service under employment`
#ASSERT NOT `the transaction is a consumer transaction` `no supply and no agreement`

§§ `2(1) "material fact", "motor vehicle sale contract", "specified dispute resolution scheme"`

#ASSERT `the information is a material fact` TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the information is a material fact` FALSE
#ASSERT `the contract is a motor vehicle sale contract` TRUE TRUE
#ASSERT NOT `the contract is a motor vehicle sale contract` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `the contract is a motor vehicle sale contract` FALSE TRUE
#ASSERT REFUSED `no regulations under section 43(2)(k) specifying a dispute resolution scheme are encoded in this model`
